claim.claim-text:
a surface vessel (12);
a tendon (254) extending between the surface vessel (12) and a base (256) disposed at a seabed (5);
an electrical cable (56) extending between the surface vessel (12) and the base (256);
a hub (264) spaced from the base (256) and coupled to the tendon (254) and the electrical cable (56); and
a J-tube (260) coupled to the base (256), wherein the electrical cable (56) extends through the J-tube (260).
